flowchart LR
    subgraph C[Client Layer]
        U[User / Analyst]
        FE[Next.js UI\nURL Scanner + Dashboard + Ledger Table]
    end

    subgraph A[API Layer - FastAPI]
        DAPI[POST /api/detect/url]
        RAPI[POST /api/report/pdf]
        LAPI[GET /api/ledger/]
    end

    subgraph E[Detection Engine]
        CORE[CoreDetectionEngine]
        FX[Feature Extraction]
        SCORE[Hybrid Scoring\n0.72 ML + 0.23 Heuristic + 0.05 HTTPS]
        RULES[Rule Overrides]
        LABEL[Label + Confidence + Reasons]
    end

    subgraph M[Model + Report]
        MODEL[(RF/XGBoost\ncore_model.pkl)]
        FALLBACK[Fallback Logistic]
        REPORT[PDF Report Builder]
    end

    subgraph S[Trust + Storage]
        LEDGER[TrustLedger\nappend + verify]
        CHAIN[(trust_ledger.json)]
        CAP[Retention: latest 50 blocks]
        BENCH[(benchmark_results.csv)]
    end

    U --> FE
    FE -->|Scan URL| DAPI
    FE -->|Download Report| RAPI
    FE -->|Fetch Audit Trail| LAPI

    DAPI --> CORE
    RAPI --> CORE
    LAPI --> LEDGER

    CORE --> FX --> SCORE
    SCORE --> MODEL
    SCORE --> FALLBACK
    SCORE --> RULES --> LABEL --> CORE

    CORE -->|Write block| LEDGER --> CHAIN
    LEDGER --> CAP

    CORE --> REPORT --> RAPI
    CORE -->|Result JSON| DAPI --> FE
    LEDGER -->|Blocks + chain_valid| LAPI --> FE

    subgraph T[Offline Training Pipeline]
        DATA[Dataset CSV] --> TRAIN[Train + Benchmark]
    end

    TRAIN --> MODEL
    TRAIN --> BENCH
